  <title xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Consultancy support for formulation of support to CBD Secretariat and the Danish Ministry of Environment</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2" xml:lang="EN">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to the formulation of two projects totaling 20 million DKK within the field of deforestation and sustainable consumption and production together with the Danish Ministry of Environment (MoE). In addition to this, support to the formulation of support totaling 14 million DKK to a trust fund under the Secretariat for the Convention on Biological Diversity (CBD).

?The objective is to support the effective preparation of three individual projects focusing on Danish development and environment priorities and formulation of Programme Documents to a level of standard enabling it to be submitted for approval.</narrative>
  </description>
